  "description": {
    "text": "The first of the yearly Pokémon TCG Holiday Calendars, released on 1 September 2022 at Pokémon Center and wherever Pokémon cards were sold: an advent calendar of 25 surprises, with something new to open each day. Eight of them are foil cards with a festive snowflake stamp. Seven reprint Sword & Shield series cards with their numbers, Ice Rider Calyrex V and VMAX and Eiscue V among them and the rest in cosmos holo; the eighth, a Pikachu, is numbered SWSH153 as a Black Star promo and is listed with that set.\n\nThe calendar also held six Sword & Shield series booster packs, six three-card fun packs, two coins, two sticker sheets, a sidekick dangler and a code card for Pokémon TCG Live.",
